\ Strict (interpreter-free) variant of user_parameter.1z. Exercises the
\ parameter slot table under --interpreter-fallback=false: any push that
\ falls through to the legacy `onez_push_word_literal` runtime lookup
\ would abort here because the dictionary lookup path is unavailable.

my-param: parameter{ [ 42 ] } ;

my-param my-param = .
my-param get .
